# vew_recipe_version (Resource)

Creates and updates a recipe version and waits for VEW validation. Release is
an explicit `vew_recipe_version_release` action. Terraform delete retires the
version. `configured_components` preserves the selected component versions;
`effective_components` reflects VEW's resolved selection.

